## Important Permissions

SSH is strict about permissions.

Recommended:

```bash
chmod 700 ~/.ssh
chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys
```

Meaning:

### 700

Owner:

```text
Read + Write + Execute
```

Others:

```text
No access
```

### 600

Owner:

```text
Read + Write
```

Others:

```text
No access
```

